/*4)factorial
Create a method factorial that takes one int argument (n) and returns (or prints) "Factorial of n is : " its factorial.
Call it from main.*/
class  Factorial_Method
{
	public static void main(String[] args) 
	{
		System.out.println("Main start from here ");
		factorial(5);
	}

	public static void factorial(int a)
	{
		int factorial=1;
		for(int i=1;i<=a;i++)
		{
			factorial=factorial*i;
		}
		System.out.println("The factorial of given "+a+" is "+factorial);
	}
}
